(text "Unused interfaces — no external signals may drive these pins.\nRockchip HW Guide V1.2 sections 2.2.2.11–2.2.2.15 recommend grounding unused PHY supplies.\nAll 14 dedicated supply balls connect to GND; signal balls have explicit no-connect markers.\nDisable PCIe3, CSI, DSI0/1, eDP and HDMI PHY/controller nodes in the device tree.\nUnpowered peripherals left enabled in DTS can hang kernel initialization (HW Guide p38).\nUSB3 and the independent PCIe2 Ethernet path use the powered combo PHYs on the preceding page." (at 162.56 231.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3fc05fe6-3cd1-5bb1-9cab-dd95f9317697"))
)
